\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Final paired results. Widths are means over 400 repetitions in each condition. Ratios divide the frozen method's mean width by PPI++ mean width. Coverage is the frozen method's observed coverage; simultaneous uncertainty is displayed in Figure~\ref {fig:coverage}. Width units differ between real-valued gene expression and binary conditions, so raw widths should not be averaged across rows.}}{6}{table.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:main}{{1}{6}{Final paired results. Widths are means over 400 repetitions in each condition. Ratios divide the frozen method's mean width by PPI++ mean width. Coverage is the frozen method's observed coverage; simultaneous uncertainty is displayed in Figure~\ref {fig:coverage}. Width units differ between real-valued gene expression and binary conditions, so raw widths should not be averaged across rows}{table.caption.5}{}}
