\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Condition-specific width comparisons. Each point divides frozen-method mean width by the indicated reference mean width; bars are the stored multiplicity-adjusted paired-bootstrap ratio intervals. (a) Predictive conditions. (b) Information controls. Values left of one are narrower, not necessarily more valid. Only gene expression is narrower than PPI++; all six other conditions favor PPI++ on mean width. The rare-outcome comparison requires the coverage and zero-width caveats in the text.}}{7}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:width}{{2}{7}{Condition-specific width comparisons. Each point divides frozen-method mean width by the indicated reference mean width; bars are the stored multiplicity-adjusted paired-bootstrap ratio intervals. (a) Predictive conditions. (b) Information controls. Values left of one are narrower, not necessarily more valid. Only gene expression is narrower than PPI++; all six other conditions favor PPI++ on mean width. The rare-outcome comparison requires the coverage and zero-width caveats in the text}{figure.caption.6}{}}
